# PII register

The index of every PII key in the vault. **No values here.** Each value lives only in the password manager, in the document item **[[= vault =]] PII register**. Rules: [[sensitive-data]].

## How to read a key

`<person-slug>.<category>.<label>`, for example `theo-vale.contact.mobile`. In a note it appears as a link to that person's heading here, with a 🔒 in front.

| Category | What it covers |
|---|---|
| `id` | National ID or tax numbers, passport, driver's license or state ID, member IDs |
| `account` | Full bank, card, loan, policy, claim, or case numbers |
| `credential` | Passwords, PINs, recovery or backup codes, security answers, API keys, a username paired with its site |
| `contact` | A private person's phone or email; any full street address |
| `dob` | Dates of birth |
| `health` | Diagnoses, medications and doses, symptoms, test results, therapy or meeting content |
| `legal` | Statements, custody or settlement terms beyond the outcome, police report detail, court and case numbers |
| `intimate` | Sexual, confessional, or relationship-private content |

